oot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-10.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:10 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Sungguh, orang-orang yang mendatangkan cobaan (bencana, membunuh, menyiksa) kepada orang-orang mukmin laki-laki dan perempuan lalu mereka tidak bertobat, m\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-10.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:10 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Sungguh, orang-orang yang mendatangkan cobaan (bencana, membunuh, menyiksa) kepada orang-orang mukmin laki-laki dan perempuan lalu mereka tidak bertobat, m\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 10</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:10</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ الَّذِينَ فَتَنُوا الْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَالْمُؤْمِنَاتِ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَتُوبُوا فَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمْ عَذَابُ الْحَرِيقِ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Sungguh, orang-orang yang mendatangkan cobaan (bencana, membunuh, menyiksa) kepada orang-orang mukmin laki-laki dan perempuan lalu mereka tidak bertobat, maka mereka akan mendapat azab Jahanam dan mereka akan mendapat azab (neraka) yang membakar.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فسرت الفتنة هاهنا بتعذيبهم المؤمنين، وإحراقهم إياهم بالنار، واللفظ أعم من ذلك<cite>«زاد المعاد في هدي خير العباد» 3/151</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويدعوهم إلى التوبة وقد حاربوه وعذبوا أولياءه وأحرقوهم بالنار.<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/317</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s85a10\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/85-2.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (85:2)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/85-14.html\">Ayat berikutnya (85:14)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-14.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:14 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Dan Dialah Yang Maha Pengampun, Maha Pengasih,\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-14.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:14 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dan Dialah Yang Maha Pengampun, Maha Pengasih,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 14</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:14</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَهُوَ الْغَفُورُ الْوَدُودُ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Dan Dialah Yang Maha Pengampun, Maha Pengasih,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Syaikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><h3>Yang beliau nukil dari selainnya</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «معناه المودود؛ كالحلوب، والركوب؛ بمعنى المحلوب والمركوب»<cite>«النبوات» 1/362</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «يغفر، ويود أن يغفر»<cite>«النبوات» 1/362</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قيل</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «المتودد إلى أوليائه بالمغفرة»<cite>«النبوات» 1/362</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">غير مسمى في المقطع</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «أي المحب لهم،»<cite>«النبوات» 1/362</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s85a14\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/85-10.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (85:10)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/85-20.html\">Ayat berikutnya (85:20)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-20.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:20 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"padahal Allah mengepung dari belakang mereka (sehingga tidak dapat lolos).\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-20.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:20 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"padahal Allah mengepung dari belakang mereka (sehingga tidak dapat lolos).\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 20</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:20</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَاللَّهُ مِن وَرَائِهِم مُّحِيطٌ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">padahal Allah mengepung dari belakang mereka (sehingga tidak dapat lolos).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهو محيط به حيث لا يحيط الشيء بنفسه وكل شيء فى قبضته وليس شيء فى قبضة نفسه،<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/22</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s85a20\">Buka di tafsir interaktif (teks lengkap)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/id/ayah/85-14.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (85:14)</a><a href=\"/id/ayah/85-22.html\">Ayat berikutnya (85:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang proyek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; ketentuan</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/85-22.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"id\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:22 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"yang (tersimpan) dalam (tempat) yang terjaga (Lauḥ Maḥfūẓ).\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/85-22.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Burooj 85:22 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnul Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"yang (tersimpan) dalam (tempat) yang terjaga (Lauḥ Maḥfūẓ).\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/id/\">Beranda</a> › <a href=\"/id/surah/85.html\">Surah Al-Burooj</a> › Ayat 22</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Burooj 85:22</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿فِي لَوْحٍ مَّحْفُوظٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemah makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">yang (tersimpan) dalam (tempat) yang terjaga (Lauḥ Maḥfūẓ).</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Indonesian Translation - Ministry of Religious Affairs — v1.0.1 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Perkataan kedua imam disajikan dalam bahasa Arab aslinya, apa adanya, beserta rujukannya.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibnul Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">والقرآن كتبه الله في اللوح المحفوظ قبل خلق السماوات والأرض كما قال تعالى: {بل هو قرآن مجيد في لوح محفوظ}<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/41</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=id#s85a